{"ref":"BDB, שׁוּעָל","hw":"שׁוּעָל","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּעָל</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:15\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.15\">Ct 2:15</a></sup> <strong>fox</strong>, perhaps also <strong>jackal</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.25\">Ne 3:25</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּעָלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:4\" href=\"/Judges.15.4\">Ju 15:4</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֻׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.4\">Ez 13:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:15\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.15\">Ct 2:15</a> b;—<em>fox</em> (prob.) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.25\">Ne 3:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:15\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.15\">Ct 2:15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; perhaps (from large no.) <em>jackal</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:4\" href=\"/Judges.15.4\">Ju 15:4</a>; as haunting ruins <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.4\">Ez 13:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:18\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.18\">La 5:18</a>; eating offal <a data-ref=\"Psalms 63:11\" href=\"/Psalms.63.11\">ψ 63:11</a>.","next":"BDB, שׁוּעָל²","prev":"BDB, שׁעל²"}